'''Snorlax''' (Japanese: '''カビゴン''' ''Kabigon'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion.

